    {
      "id": "claim_226b3281bba54908aacb2c878c1b436e",
      "statement": "The server supports two API Gateway event formats selectable via `--event-format v1|v2` (default `v1`): `build_rest_api_event()` synthesizes a v1 REST API payload with `resource`, `path`, `httpMethod`, original-case `headers` and `multiValueHeaders`, single-value and multi-value query parameters built from `request.query_params.multi_items()` to preserve duplicate keys, `pathParameters`, `body`, `isBase64Encoded`, and `requestContext` containing `stage: 'local'`, `requestId`, `identity.sourceIp`, and `authorizer`; `build_http_api_event()` synthesizes a v2 HTTP API payload with `version: '2.0'`, `routeKey`, `rawPath`, `rawQueryString`, lowercase comma-joined headers, comma-joined query params for duplicates, and `requestContext` containing `http`, `authorizer.lambda` (wrapping the auth context), `time`, and `timeEpoch`; `build_event()` dispatches to the appropriate builder based on the format.",
      "evidence": [
