    {
      "id": "claim_5fd79831358f40af81843cd56353ad1c",
      "statement": "The CLI surface in `local_cli.py` provides a `local` Click group with `invoke_without_command=True` that accepts `--port` (default 3000), `--host` (default `127.0.0.1`), `--event-format` (choice `v1`/`v2`, default `v1`), `--auth-context` (JSON file path or inline JSON string), and a `directory` argument (default `.`, must exist); when invoked without a subcommand it parses the auth context, loads resources, and calls the `local()` facade which sets global envvars, injects `AWS_DEFAULT_REGION`/`AWS_REGION` from `target_region` and `AWS_PROFILE` from the CLI profile or `EASYSAM_AWS_PROFILE`, builds the app, and runs uvicorn; the `invoke` subcommand accepts a required function name and an optional `--event` (file path, inline JSON, or default `{}`), loads resources, sets global and per-function envvars, creates a `MockLambdaContext`, invokes the handler via `asyncio.run(load_and_invoke(...))`, and prints the result as JSON with `default=str` to handle non-serializable types.",
      "evidence": [
